    "created_at": "2019-12-12T19:05:12Z",
    "updated_at": "2019-12-12T19:05:12Z",
    "body": "Adding something like an explicit `COEP: unsafe-none` declaration is probably a good thing to do. I don't know if we're going to be able to shift this default, but it seems reasonable to aim for CORP requirements by default as a medium-term goal...",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
